salam khaak nasheeno pa sogwaro ka<br>
ghareeb dete hai pursa tumhare pyaro ka<br>
<br>
salam un pa jinhe sharm khaaye jaati hai<br>
khule saro'n pe aseeri ki khaak aati hai<br>
<br>
salam us pa jo zahmat kashe salaasil hai<br>
musibato'n me imamat ki pehli manzil hai<br>
<br>
salam bhejte hai apni shahzadi par<br>
ke jisko sawnp gaye marte waqt ghar sarwar<br>
<br>
musafirat ne jise bebasi ye dikhlayi<br>
nisar kar diye bache na bach saka bhai<br>
<br>
aseer ho ke jise shaamiyo ke narghe me<br>
husainiyat hai sikhaana ali ke lehje me<br>
<br>
sakina bibi tumhare ghulam haazir hai<br>
bujhe jo pyas to ashko'n ke jaam haazir hai<br>
<br>
ye sin, ye hashr ye sadme naye naye bibi<br>
kaha'n pa baithi ho qaime to jal gaye bibi<br>
<br>
pahaad raat badi der hai sawere me<br>
kaha'n ho shaam-e-ghareeba'n ke ghup andhere me<br>
<br>
zameen garm, yateemi ki saqtiya'n bibi<br>
wo seena jis pa ke soti thi ab kahan bibi<br>
<br>
janaab-e-maadar-e-besheer ko bhi sab ka salam<br>
ajeeb waqt hai kya de'n tasalliyo ka payaam<br>
<br>
abhi kaleje me ek aag si lagi hogi<br>
abhi to godh ki garmi na kam hui hogi<br>
<br>
nahin andhere me kuch soojhta kaha'n dhundhen<br>
tumhara chaand kaha'n chhup gaya kaha'n dhundhen<br>
<br>
na is tarah koi kheti hari bhari ujdi<br>
tumhari maang bhi ujdi hai godh bhi ujdi<br>
<br>
nahi layeeno me insaa'n koi khuda hafiz<br>
darinde aur ye be-waarisi khuda hafiz<br>
<br>
shareek-e-haq darood-o-salam-e-paighambar<br>
salam sayyid-e-lawlaak ke lute ghar par<br>
<br>
salam mohsin-e-islam khasta tan laasho<br>
salam tum pe shaheedo ke be kafan laasho<br>
<br>
salam tum pe rasool-o-batool ke pyaro<br>
salam mehr-e-shahadat ke gird sayyaaro<br>
<br>
bache to agle baras ham hai'n aur ye gham phir hai<br>
Jo chal base to ye apna salaam-e-aakhir hai